:"Conjugate gradients on the Laplacian grounded at ","type":"text"},{"code":"target","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", from 0, until the residual’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Euclidean norm is at most ","type":"text"},{"code":"tolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (relative to the right-hand side, which has norm 1),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or, on a weight spread that puts that below rounding, until the true residual stops","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"improving. Jacobi preconditioned for 300 iterations, then by a modified incomplete Cholesky","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"factor in maximum-spanning-tree order. O((n + m) √κ) time; about 9 n words, and O(n + m) for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the factor when it is built. Traps after 20,000 + 2n products, which no input has reached","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the measurements.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weight"},{"type":"text","text":" gives the conductance of the edge at each position, read once per position (every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position, also outside the component); a weight of 0 is no edge."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"target"},{"type":"text","text":" are vertices of the graph, every weight is finite and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nonnegative, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance > 0"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"title":"Vertex","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"associat